  "prefLabel": "Emp 407.02 Benefits Available",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 407.02 Benefits Available. RSA 282-A:30, I.(d)(3)(C)’s prohibition of the application of New Hampshire’s “on” indicator for the state-federal extended benefit program when benefits are available under any federal unemployment program need not be applied at any time for which 100% federal funding is available to reimburse benefits paid under the state-federal extended benefit program.\n\nSource. #9764 EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-30-10, EXPIRED: 1-26-11",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emp100-500.html"
